    "detailed_description": "The killer cars are back, and they're everywhere! It's not just one junkyard this time. There's multiple locations that need to be shut down. You will have to prep for these areas, strategizing ways to neutralize the instances inside them. Only problem is that they're faster and smarter than before. Will you succeed?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br>- Enter multiple locations exploring vast areas and surviving through experiments.<br>- Scavenge items and tools to aid your objectives inside the areas.<br>- Investigate and discover anomalies to properly handle cases.<br>- Drive and repair vehicles throughout areas to get around faster.",
